===Etymology===
From a [[pronunciation spelling]] of {{m|en|Australian}} spoken with this accent. Coined by “[[w:Afferbeck Lauder|Afferbeck Lauder]]” (Alastair Ardoch Morrison) and popularised with his 1965 book ''Let Stalk Strine''. Australian from 1965.

